---
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
---

<LegalPage
  title="SMS Consent"
  eyebrow="Messaging compliance"
  description="How AllegrowAI collects optional consent before sending transactional SMS verification messages."
>
  <h2>SMS program purpose</h2>
  <p>
    AllegrowAI sends transactional SMS messages only when a user voluntarily requests
    SMS-based authentication or account verification for an AllegrowAI-operated product
    or workflow. The messages are limited to one-time passcodes, account verification,
    and related security notices. AllegrowAI does not use this toll-free number for
    marketing or promotional messaging.
  </p>

  <h2>How users opt in</h2>
  <p>
    Before SMS messages are sent, the user is shown an optional consent disclosure near
    the phone number field or SMS verification action. The user can choose not to use
    SMS where another sign-in or verification method is available.
  </p>
  <div class="notice">
    <strong>Consent disclosure:</strong> By selecting SMS verification, you agree to
    receive transactional verification text messages from AllegrowAI at the phone number
    you provide. Consent is optional and is not a condition of purchase. Message
    frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP
    for help.
  </div>

  <h2>Message examples</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Your AllegrowAI verification code is 123456. It expires in 10 minutes. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help. Msg & data rates may apply.</li>
    <li>AllegrowAI: You are opted in to receive transactional verification codes. Msg & data rates may apply. Reply HELP for help or STOP to opt out.</li>
    <li>AllegrowAI: For help, contact <a href="mailto:john@allegrowai.com">john@allegrowai.com</a>. Reply STOP to opt out. Msg & data rates may apply.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Opt-out and help</h2>
  <p>
    Users can reply STOP to opt out of further SMS messages from the toll-free number.
    Users can reply HELP for support information, or contact
    <a href="mailto:john@allegrowai.com">john@allegrowai.com</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Related policies</h2>
  <p>
    See the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> and
    <a href="/terms">Terms & Conditions</a> for additional details.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
